   "title": "Refinancing a Shopping Center: Timing, Preparation, and Appraisal",
   "part": "Part III — Financing",
   "eyebrow": "FINANCING",
   "deck": "A refinance is won in the twelve months before the application. Here is the runway, the package, and the closing traps.",
   "date": "2026-09-22",
   "read_time": "7 min",
